      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIA INTENTION (1) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split and ran away with a 5 length win at this track over 390m in 22.26. Will go close again if runs up to latest. YALE TURN (4) was well off top last time, finishing 5th (19.78) in a Mix 6/7 at Healesville. Has won here at this journey. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Key player if finds best. ASTON GIOVANNI (7) showed strong early pace and stuck on well despite finishing out of the placings when fourth over 425m Bendigo in 24.15. Can figure in the finish. VISTA HOIST (2) justified the favourite's tag last time and another big run is on the cards.",
